        {
            "Id": 141411042,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 40,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你看，就是那种。我明明觉得“这首歌大家肯定都能嗨起来！”才选的，/n结果现场却有种“呃，好像不对？”的空气，不是会有吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110380",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411043,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 41,
            "SpeakerName": "和尚",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "有啊！为了和新檀家搞好关系去小酒馆，/n场子都热起来了，结果选了首人家不喜欢的歌——那种吧！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110390",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411044,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 42,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "大概就是这个！我和伊吕波亲她们去唱K的时候，/n大家都很会配合，所以会跟着一起嗨。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110400",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 10,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40321,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411045,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 43,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "可最开始几次没伊吕波亲她们、只和电姬其他人去的时候，/n就变成互相试探气氛的那种！！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110410",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411046,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 44,
            "SpeakerName": "和尚",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嘛，兴趣就是这么回事。/n合得来合不来，本来就没办法。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110420",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411047,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 45,
            "SpeakerName": "和尚",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "尤其是网络，仗着匿名在背后说难听话的人肯定会有。/n一开始就把这部分折算进去看就行了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110430",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411048,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 46,
            "SpeakerName": "和尚",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "再说了，你自己想做的东西，/n真知子她们不是也认可了吗。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110440",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141411049,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 47,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯……话说你什么时候和Boss她们认识的！？/n我后来听说的时候越想越好笑！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414110450",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 40321,
